terminal-pong
------------------------------------------
Classic ping-pong game written in c++17 and played in terminal

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libncursesw10-6.5+20240427-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/kumaran-14/terminal-pong

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/kumaran-14/terminal-pong/archive/refs/tags/1.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack terminal-pong-1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./terminal-pong-1.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/terminal-pong-1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/terminal-pong-1.0.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(terminal-pong)
  /usr/bin/pong.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/terminal-pong.README
  /usr/share/doc/terminal-pong/README.md

------------------

